text tsfavp "<p class=\"so-muted\">Favorites are private: only you can see this list.</p>\n"
text tslg1 "<h1>Sign in with your Radicle key</h1>\n<p>There is no password. You prove that you hold the key behind your Radicle DID by signing a one-time challenge with it.</p>\n<ol class=\"so-steps\">\n<li>Print your DID:<pre class=\"so-cmd\">rad self --did</pre></li>\n<li>Sign this challenge (valid for 15 minutes):<pre class=\"so-cmd\">printf %s '"
text tslg2 "' | ssh-keygen -Y sign -f ~/.radicle/keys/radicle -n interplane-forge</pre>If your key is held by ssh-agent (after <code>rad auth</code>), pass <code>-f ~/.radicle/keys/radicle.pub</code> instead.</li>\n<li>Paste your DID and the whole signature block below.</li>\n</ol>\n<form class=\"so-form\" method=\"post\" action=\""
text tslg3 "\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"csrf\" value=\""
text tslg4 "\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"nonce\" value=\""
text tslg5 "\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"ts\" value=\""
text tslg6 "\">\n<label for=\"so-did\">DID</label>\n<input id=\"so-did\" name=\"did\" type=\"text\" maxlength=\"100\" required autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"did:key:z6Mk...\">\n<label for=\"so-sig\">Signature</label>\n<textarea id=\"so-sig\" name=\"sig\" rows=\"8\" cols=\"72\" maxlength=\"4000\" required spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea>\n<button class=\"so-btn\" type=\"submit\">Sign in</button>\n</form>\n<p class=\"so-muted\">Sign-in by email link is designed but switched off on this forge.</p>\n"
text tsin1 "<p>You are signed in as <b>"
text tsin2 "</b>.</p>\n"
text tsin3 "Settings"
text tsst1 "<h1>Settings</h1>\n<h2>Account</h2>\n<p>DID: <code>"
text tsst2 "</code></p>\n<p>Display name: <b>"
text tsst2n "</code></p>\n<p>Display name: <span class=\"so-muted\">not set</span>"
text tsst3 "</b>"
text tsst4 "</p>\n"
text tsst5 "<form class=\"so-form\" method=\"post\" action=\""
text tsst6 "\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"csrf\" value=\""
text tsst7 "\">\n<label for=\"so-name\">New display name</label>\n<input id=\"so-name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" maxlength=\"39\" required autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\">\n<button class=\"so-btn\" type=\"submit\">Save name</button>\n</form>\n<p class=\"so-muted\">Lowercase letters, digits and inner hyphens, up to 39 characters. Your public profile shows this name and links your DID.</p>\n<h2>Email sign-in</h2>\n<p class=\"so-muted\">Switched off. Sign-in links by email are designed but not enabled on this forge.</p>\n<h2>Session</h2>\n"
text tsbout "Sign out"
